{"suttaId":"tha-ap552","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[5799,5921],"vripara":"272"},"segments":{"tha-ap552:0.3":"Cūḷasugandhattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap552:1.1":"“Imamhi bhaddake kappe, brahmabandhu mahāyaso;","tha-ap552:1.3":"Kassapo nāma gottena, uppajji vadataṃ varo.","tha-ap552:2.1":"“Anubyañjanasampanno, bāttiṃsavaralakkhaṇo;","tha-ap552:2.3":"Byāmappabhāparivuto, raṃsijālasamotthaṭo.","tha-ap552:3.1":"“Assāsetā yathā cando, sūriyova pabhaṅkaro;","tha-ap552:3.3":"Nibbāpetā yathā megho, sāgarova guṇākaro.","tha-ap552:4.1":"“Dharaṇīriva sīlena, himavāva samādhinā;","tha-ap552:4.3":"Ākāso viya paññāya, asaṅgo anilo yathā.","tha-ap552:5.1":"“Tadāhaṃ bārāṇasiyaṃ, upapanno mahākule;","tha-ap552:5.3":"Pahūtadhanadhaññasmiṃ, nānāratanasañcaye.","tha-ap552:6.1":"“Mahatā parivārena, nisinnaṃ lokanāyakaṃ;","tha-ap552:6.3":"Upecca dhammamassosiṃ, amataṃva manoharaṃ.","tha-ap552:7.1":"“Dvattiṃsalakkhaṇadharo, sanakkhattova candimā;","tha-ap552:7.3":"Anubyañjanasampanno, sālarājāva phullito.","tha-ap552:8.1":"“Raṃsijālaparikkhitto, dittova kanakācalo;","tha-ap552:8.3":"Byāmappabhāparivuto, sataraṃsī divākaro.","tha-ap552:9.1":"“Soṇṇānano jinavaro, samaṇīva [rammaṇīva (syā.)] siluccayo;","tha-ap552:9.3":"Karuṇāpuṇṇahadayo, guṇena viya sāgaro.","tha-ap552:10.1":"“Lokavissutakitti ca, sinerūva naguttamo;","tha-ap552:10.3":"Yasasā vitthato vīro, ākāsasadiso muni.","tha-ap552:11.1":"“Asaṅgacitto sabbattha, anilo viya nāyako;","tha-ap552:11.3":"Patiṭṭhā sabbabhūtānaṃ, mahīva munisattamo.","tha-ap552:12.1":"“Anupalitto lokena, toyena padumaṃ yathā;","tha-ap552:12.3":"Kuvādagacchadahano, aggikhandhova sobhasi [sobhati (sī.), so vasi (syā. ka.)].","tha-ap552:13.1":"“Agadho viya sabbattha, kilesavisanāsako;","tha-ap552:13.3":"Gandhamādanaselova, guṇagandhavibhūsito.","tha-ap552:14.1":"“Guṇānaṃ ākaro vīro, ratanānaṃva sāgaro;","tha-ap552:14.3":"Sindhūva vanarājīnaṃ, kilesamalahārako.","tha-ap552:15.1":"“Vijayīva mahāyodho, mārasenāvamaddano;","tha-ap552:15.3":"Cakkavattīva so rājā, bojjhaṅgaratanissaro.","tha-ap552:16.1":"“Mahābhisakkasaṅkāso, dosabyādhitikicchako;","tha-ap552:16.3":"Sallakatto yathā vejjo, diṭṭhigaṇḍaviphālako.","tha-ap552:17.1":"“So tadā lokapajjoto, sanarāmarasakkato;","tha-ap552:17.3":"Parisāsu narādicco, dhammaṃ desayate jino.","tha-ap552:18.1":"“Dānaṃ datvā mahābhogo, sīlena sugatūpago;","tha-ap552:18.3":"Bhāvanāya ca nibbāti, iccevamanusāsatha.","tha-ap552:19.1":"“Desanaṃ taṃ mahassādaṃ, ādimajjhantasobhaṇaṃ;","tha-ap552:19.3":"Suṇanti parisā sabbā, amataṃva mahārasaṃ.","tha-ap552:20.1":"“Sutvā sumadhuraṃ dhammaṃ, pasanno jinasāsane;","tha-ap552:20.3":"Sugataṃ saraṇaṃ gantvā, yāvajīvaṃ namassahaṃ.","tha-ap552:21.1":"“Munino gandhakuṭiyā, opuñjesiṃ [ubbaṭṭesiṃ (syā.)] tadā mahiṃ;","tha-ap552:21.3":"Catujjātena gandhena, māse aṭṭha dinesvahaṃ.","tha-ap552:22.1":"“Paṇidhāya sugandhattaṃ, sarīravissagandhino [sarīrassa vigandhino (sī. syā. pī.)];","tha-ap552:22.3":"Tadā jino viyākāsi, sugandhatanulābhitaṃ.","tha-ap552:23.1":"“‘Yo yaṃ gandhakuṭibhūmiṃ, gandhenopuñjate sakiṃ;","tha-ap552:23.3":"Tena kammavipākena, upapanno tahiṃ tahiṃ.","tha-ap552:24.1":"“‘Sugandhadeho sabbattha, bhavissati ayaṃ naro;","tha-ap552:24.3":"Guṇagandhayutto hutvā, nibbāyissatināsavo’.","tha-ap552:25.1":"“Tena kammena sukatena, cetanāpaṇidhīhi ca;","tha-ap552:25.3":"Jahitvā mānusaṃ dehaṃ, tāvatiṃsamagacchahaṃ.","tha-ap552:26.1":"“Pacchime ca bhave dāni, jāto vippakule ahaṃ;","tha-ap552:26.3":"Gabbhaṃ me vasato mātā, dehenāsi sugandhitā.","tha-ap552:27.1":"“Yadā ca mātukucchimhā, nikkhamāmi tadā purī [puraṃ (syā. ka.)];","tha-ap552:27.3":"Sāvatthisabbagandhehi, vāsitā viya vāyatha.","tha-ap552:28.1":"“Pupphavassañca surabhi, dibbagandhaṃ manoramaṃ;","tha-ap552:28.3":"Dhūpāni ca mahagghāni, upavāyiṃsu tāvade.","tha-ap552:29.1":"“Devā ca sabbagandhehi, dhūpapupphehi taṃ gharaṃ;","tha-ap552:29.3":"Vāsayiṃsu sugandhena, yasmiṃ jāto ahaṃ ghare.","tha-ap552:30.1":"“Yadā ca taruṇo bhaddo, paṭhame yobbane ṭhito;","tha-ap552:30.3":"Tadā selaṃ [sesaṃ (syā.)] saparisaṃ, vinetvā narasārathi.","tha-ap552:31.1":"“Tehi sabbehi parivuto [sahito (sī. syā. pī.)], sāvatthipuramāgato;","tha-ap552:31.3":"Tadā buddhānubhāvaṃ taṃ, disvā pabbajito ahaṃ.","tha-ap552:32.1":"“Sīlaṃ samādhipaññañca, vimuttiñca anuttaraṃ;","tha-ap552:32.3":"Bhāvetvā caturo dhamme, pāpuṇiṃ āsavakkhayaṃ.","tha-ap552:33.1":"“Yadā pabbajito cāhaṃ, yadā ca arahā ahuṃ;","tha-ap552:33.3":"Nibbāyissaṃ yadā cāhaṃ, gandhavasso tadā ahu.","tha-ap552:34.1":"“Sarīragandho ca sadātiseti [sadā vāseti (ka.)] me, mahārahaṃ candanacampakuppalaṃ;","tha-ap552:34.3":"Tatheva gandhe itare ca sabbaso, pasayha vāyāmi tato tahiṃ [yahiṃ (syā.)] tahiṃ.","tha-ap552:35.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap552:36.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap552:37.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap552:38.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā cūḷasugandho thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti;","tha-ap552:39.1":"Cūḷasugandhattherassāpadānaṃ dasamaṃ.","tha-ap552:40.1":"Bhaddiyavaggo pañcapaññāsamo.","tha-ap552:41.1":"Tassuddānaṃ –","tha-ap552:42.1":"Bhaddiyo revato thero, mahālābhī ca sīvalī;","tha-ap552:42.3":"Vaṅgīso nandako ceva, kāḷudāyī tathābhayo.","tha-ap552:43.1":"Lomaso vanavaccho ca, sugandho ceva dasamo;","tha-ap552:43.3":"Tīṇi gāthāsatā tattha, soḷasā ca taduttari.","tha-ap552:44.1":"Atha vagguddānaṃ –","tha-ap552:45.1":"Kaṇikāravhayo vaggo, phalado tiṇadāyako;","tha-ap552:45.3":"Kaccāno bhaddiyo vaggo, gāthāyo gaṇitā cimā.","tha-ap552:46.1":"Navagāthāsatānīha, caturāsītiyeva ca;","tha-ap552:46.3":"Sapaññāsaṃ pañcasataṃ, apadānā pakāsitā.","tha-ap552:47.1":"Saha udānagāthāhi, chasahassāni hontimā;","tha-ap552:47.3":"Dvesatāni ca gāthānaṃ, aṭṭhārasa taduttari."},"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":3731,"to":3731,"paras":[{"para":3731,"vripara":"272","refs":["tha-ap552:1"],"lines":["Sopi thero arahattaṃ patvā attano pubbakammaṃ saritvā somanassajāto pubbacaritāpadānaṃ pakāsento <b>imamhi bhaddake kappe</b>tiādimāha.","Taṃ sabbaṃ heṭṭhā vuttanayattā uttānatthattā ca suviññeyyameva, kevalaṃ puññanānattaṃ nāmanānattañca viseso."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap552:1"],["tha-ap552:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[["tha-ap552:1.1","imamhi bhaddake kappe",0,0]]},"tika":null,"tika2":null}
